 ('system-client','Distributed systems','Tap the component that initiates the HTTP request.',['Client','Load balancer','API','Cache'],'Client','The client sends the request; every other component reacts to it.','raft'),
 ('system-durable','Databases','Tap the component where a committed transaction becomes durable.',['API','Cache','Queue','Database'],'Database','The database writes committed changes to stable storage, usually through its write-ahead log.','postgres'),
 ('system-api','Databases','Tap the component that validates requests and applies business rules before storage.',['Client','API','Cache','Database'],'API','The API layer checks input and enforces rules so storage only receives valid changes.','postgres'),
